entStart`/`SubagentEnd` in the future.\ncmd/entire/cli/agent/copilotcli/AGENT.md:212:files snapshot). The `handleLifecycleSubagentEnd` dispatcher falls back to the session's\ncmd/entire/cli/agent/copilotcli/transcript_test.go:18:// with tool.execution_complete events for file modification tracking.\ncmd/entire/cli/agent/copilotcli/transcript_test.go:24:\t`{\"type\":\"tool.execution_complete\",\"data\":{\"toolCallId\":\"tc1\",\"toolTelemetry\":{\"properties\":{\"filePaths\":\"[\\\"/tmp/test/hello.txt\\\"]\"},\"metrics\":{\"linesAdded\":1,\"linesRemoved\":0}}},\"id\":\"5\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-03-03T00:00:04Z\",\"parentId\":\"4\"}`,\ncmd/entire/cli/agent/copilotcli/transcript_test.go:43:\tt.Run(\"extracts files from tool.execution_complete\", func(t *testing.T) {\ncmd/entire/cli/agent/copilotcli/transcript_test.go:66:\t\t// Two tool.execution_complete events touching the same file\ncmd/entire/cli/agent/copilotcli/transcript_test.go:68:\t\t\t`{\"type\":\"tool.execution_complete\",\"data\":{\"toolCallId\":\"tc1\",\"toolTelemetry\":{\"properties\":{\"filePaths\":\"[\\\"/tmp/test/hello.txt\\\"]\"},\"metrics\":{\"linesAdded\":1,\"linesRemoved\":0}}},\"id\":\"5\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-03-03T00:00:04Z\",\"parentId\":\"4\"}`,\ncmd/entire/cli/agent/copilotcli/transcript_test.go:69:\t\t\t`{\"type\":\"tool.execution_complete\",\"data\":{\"toolCallId\":\"tc2\",\"toolTelemetry\":{\"properties\":{\"filePaths\":\"[\\\"/tmp/test/hello.txt\\\",\\\"/tmp/test/world.txt\\\"]\"},\"metrics\":{\"linesAdded\":2,\"linesRemoved\":0}}},\"id\":\"8\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-03-03T00:00:07Z\",\"parentId\":\"6\"}`,\ncmd/entire/cli/agent/copilotcli/transcript_test.go:213:\t\t// Offset 5 means skip first 5 lines (tool.execution_complete is line 5)\ncmd/entire/cli/agent/copilotcli/transcript_test.go:350:\t\t\t`{\"type\":\"tool.execution_complete\",\"data\":{\"toolCallId\":\"tc1\",\"toolTelemetry\":{\"properties\":{\"filePaths\":\"\"},\"metrics\":{\"linesAdded\":0,\"linesRemoved\":0}}},\"id\":\"1\",\"times