{"timestamp":"2026-09-04T06:09:19.032Z","ordinal":10805,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a06465-c2da-73f2-a18c-e3568bc720c2","turn_id":"01a06aeb-fba1-7c73-b9bd-e6c66f69b450","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0cd19a3be99e9a99016a9a608cdd8087d09b0dbc91ca5df1c0","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\n- The shared lifecycle needed only one narrow extension: a “completion learned without launch” event can create a task record only inside an already-active parent session. Missing or ended state remains a no-op, so late hooks cannot resurrect sessions.\n- Copilot’s child files are adapter-derived before dispatch, so shared lifecycle skips both the whole-worktree scan and the generic child-transcript analyzer. That avoids attributing the parent’s or a concurrent child’s files to the wrong task.\n- A persisted `transcript_unavailable` bit is important even though it is small: without it, condensation would probe Claude-style `agent-<id>.jsonl` paths and could attach an unrelated file to a Copilot child.\n`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`"}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1788502156905,"completed_at_ms":1788502159032}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-04T06:09:19.036Z","ordinal":10806,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_0cd19a3be99e9a99016a9a608cdd8087d09b0dbc91ca5df1c0","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\n- The shared lifecycle needed only one narrow extension: a “completion learned without launch” event can create a task record only inside an already-active parent session. Missing or ended state remains a no-op, so late hooks cannot resurrect sessions.\n- Copilot’s child files are adapter-derived before dispatch, so shared lifecycle skips both the whole-worktree scan and the generic child-transcript analyzer. That avoids attributing the parent’s or a concurrent child’s files to the wrong task.\n- A persisted `transcript_unavailable` bit is important even though it is small: without it, condensation would probe Claude-style `agent-<id>.jsonl` paths and could attach an unrelated file to a Copilot child.\n`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`"}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a06aeb-fba1-7c73-b9bd-e6c66f69b450","create_time":1788502155.368133,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}}}
