ction is discarded;\\n+// nothing was written). CompletionWithoutLaunch events may create the record\\n+// here, but only while their parent state exists and is active.\\n@@\\n-\\t\\t// No live marker: this ToolUseID was already completed at launch-time\\n+\\t\\t// No live marker: this ToolUseID was already completed at launch-time\\n@@\\n-\\t\\t// emitting the launch-time marker — worth surfacing over Debug.\\n+\\t\\t// emitting the launch-time marker — worth surfacing over Debug. A\\n+\\t\\t// CompletionWithoutLaunch event is the explicit exception handled above.\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a06aeb-fba1-7c73-b9bd-e6c66f69b450","create_time":1788509537.30061}}}
