{"timestamp":"2026-09-04T17:03:14.756Z","ordinal":11455,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a06465-c2da-73f2-a18c-e3568bc720c2","turn_id":"01a06aeb-fba1-7c73-b9bd-e6c66f69b450","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0cd19a3be99e9a99016a9af9d1426087d09180112d236bb85f","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The reviewer pass found one high-impact gap before commit: current Copilot 1.0.82 uses the child UUID—not the historical `toolu_` prefix—for subordinate `userPromptSubmitted` and `agentStop` hooks. Without an additional check, those can still create phantom top-level Entire sessions even though task attribution itself is correct. I’m using the captured parent-transcript relationship to suppress those UUID child lifecycle hooks, then I’ll add the regression test before running the full gate."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1788541393317,"completed_at_ms":1788541394756}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-04T17:03:14.757Z","ordinal":11456,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_0cd19a3be99e9a99016a9af9d1426087d09180112d236bb85f","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"The reviewer pass found one high-impact gap before commit: current Copilot 1.0.82 uses the child UUID—not the historical `toolu_` prefix—for subordinate `userPromptSubmitted` and `agentStop` hooks. Without an additional check, those can still create phantom top-level Entire sessions even though task attribution itself is correct. I’m using the captured parent-transcript relationship to suppress those UUID child lifecycle hooks, then I’ll add the regression test before running the full gate."}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a06aeb-fba1-7c73-b9bd-e6c66f69b450","create_time":1788541387.622698,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}}}
