from the start of each subagent transcript (agent IDs are discovered from\ncmd/entire/cli/session/state.go:326:\t// the full main transcript so subagents spawned before the checkpoint\ncmd/entire/cli/session/state.go:332:\tSubagentTokensBaseline *agent.TokenUsage `json:\"subagent_tokens_baseline,omitempty\"`\ncmd/entire/cli/session/state.go:423:\t// TaskRecords tracks subagents dispatched by this session — the durable\ncmd/entire/cli/session/state.go:424:\t// pointer ledger for subagent work. See TaskRecord.\ncmd/entire/cli/session/state.go:428:// TaskRecord is the durable pointer ledger entry for a subagent dispatched by\ncmd/entire/cli/session/state.go:433:// see docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-19-subagent-durable-records.md.\ncmd/entire/cli/session/state.go:451:\t// AgentID is the subagent identifier (tool_response.agentId at launch\ncmd/entire/cli/session/state.go:452:\t// time), used to resolve the subagent's own transcript file.\ncmd/entire/cli/session/state.go:464:\tSubagentType    string `json:\"subagent_type,omitempty\"`\ncmd/entire/cli/session/state.go:467:\t// DeclaredTranscriptPath is the subagent transcript path an agent's stop\ncmd/entire/cli/session/state.go:475:\t// TranscriptUnavailable is set when the agent stores child activity only in\ncmd/entire/cli/session/state.go:478:\tTranscriptUnavailable bool `json:\"transcript_unavailable,omitempty\"`\ncmd/entire/cli/session/state.go:480:\t// Files is the set of files touched by this subagent, merged into the\ncmd/entire/cli/session/state.go:483:\t// read-only subagent.\ncmd/entire/cli/session/state.go:486:\t// TokenUsage is this subagent's token usage, when the completing hook\ncmd/entire/cli/session/state.go:495:// AddTaskRecord records a subagent launch, replacing any existing entry with\ncmd/entire/cli/session/state.go:563:// HasTaskContent reports whether this session carries pending subagent task\ncmd/entire/cli/session/state.go:707:// RebaselineSubagentTokens snapshots the current cumulative subagen