{"timestamp":"2026-09-04T17:27:11.399Z","ordinal":11885,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a06465-c2da-73f2-a18c-e3568bc720c2","turn_id":"01a06aeb-fba1-7c73-b9bd-e6c66f69b450","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0cd19a3be99e9a99016a9aff6d852487d09ba862134e2846a2","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The full gate exposed two failures, neither in the Copilot code:\n\n- `integration_test` timed out in `TestMain` while waiting for its one-time CLI build subprocess.\n- `redact` failed because its temporary fixture’s intentionally constructed `go.mod` became malformed during a race-enabled environment-isolation test.\n\nEvery changed package—including Copilot, shared lifecycle, session, and strategy—passed under `-race`. I’m now reproducing those two failures independently to determine whether they are transient suite concurrency or a real branch regression before deciding the right closure path."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1788542829536,"completed_at_ms":1788542831399}}
