{"timestamp":"2026-09-09T22:08:32.186Z","ordinal":12524,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a06465-c2da-73f2-a18c-e3568bc720c2","turn_id":"01a08836-f90b-7003-8dcb-63827244a5e5","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0cd19a3be99e9a99016aa1d8de5b6087d0a68bcb292fa28da3","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\n- The paid E2E and direct `copilot -p` smoke prove the product behavior, but they do not replace the repository’s mandatory pre-commit gate.\n- Because compatibility code and assertions changed after the earlier broad check, the final tree needs one fresh `mise run check`.\n- If the same known workspace-path test fails again, I’ll separate that infrastructure failure from any feature failure and still rerun the remaining suite with the established workaround.\n`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`"}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1788991710403,"completed_at_ms":1788991712186}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-09T22:08:32.189Z","ordinal":12525,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_0cd19a3be99e9a99016aa1d8de5b6087d0a68bcb292fa28da3","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\n- The paid E2E and direct `copilot -p` smoke prove the product behavior, but they do not replace the repository’s mandatory pre-commit gate.\n- Because compatibility code and assertions changed after the earlier broad check, the final tree needs one fresh `mise run check`.\n- If the same known workspace-path test fails again, I’ll separate that infrastructure failure from any feature failure and still rerun the remaining suite with the established workaround.\n`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`"}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a08836-f90b-7003-8dcb-63827244a5e5","create_time":1788991705.783003,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}}}
