{"timestamp":"2026-09-09T22:43:11.320Z","ordinal":12964,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a06465-c2da-73f2-a18c-e3568bc720c2","turn_id":"01a08856-b8b4-75a1-a2ff-e25e0bf384b1","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-631155fc-64f9-4f2d-b0ec-446a9d66e338","process_id":"75777","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","entire trail --help"],"cwd":"file:///Users/peytonmontei/Documents/Documents%20-%20Peyton%E2%80%99s%20MacBook%20Pro/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/subagents","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"entire trail --help"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"A trail ties together the context for a branch. Use `entire trail` to view, create, update, or watch it; use `entire trail finding` to manage agent findings. The legacy backend is the default; set ENTIRE_TRAILS_BACKEND=entire-api to use the new backend.\n\nUsage:\n  entire trail [flags]\n  entire trail [command]\n\nAvailable Commands:\n  approvals       List approval decisions on a trail\n  approve         Approve a trail\n  checkout        Check out a trail's branch\n  comment         Manage discussion threads on a trail\n  create          Create a trail for the current, a new, or no branch\n  delete          Delete a trail\n  finding         Manage a trail's agent findings\n  list            List recent trails\n  request-changes Request changes on a trail\n  resume          Resume a trail's agent session\n  show            Show a trail\n  update          Update trail metadata\n  watch           Tail a trail's events live\n\nFlags:\n  -h, --help          help for trail\n      --repo string   Target repository as forge/owner/repo (e.g. gh/acme/app) or a clone URL; defaults to the origin remote\n\nGlobal Flags:\n      --context name   Act as this saved login name for this command only, instead of the active context (entire auth contexts lists them)\n\nUse \"entire trail [command] --help\" for more information about a command.\n","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"A trail ties together the context for a branch. Use `entire trail` to view, create, update, or watch it; use `entire trail finding` to manage agent findings. The legacy backend is the default; set ENTIRE_TRAILS_BACKEND=entire-api to use the new backend.\n\nUsage:\n  entire trail [flags]\n  entire trail [command]\n\nAvailable Commands:\n  approvals       List approval decisions on a trail\n  approve         Approve a trail\n  checkout        Check out a trail's branch\n  comment         Manage discussion threads on a trail\n  create          Create a trail for the current, a new, or no branch\n  delete          Delete a trail\n  finding         Manage a trail's agent findings\n  list            List recent trails\n  request-changes Request changes on a trail\n  resume          Resume a trail's agent session\n  show            Show a trail\n  update          Update trail metadata\n  watch           Tail a trail's events live\n\nFlags:\n  -h, --help          help for trail\n      --repo string   Target repository as forge/owner/repo (e.g. gh/acme/app) or a clone URL; defaults to the origin remote\n\nGlobal Flags:\n      --context name   Act as this saved login name for this command only, instead of the active context (entire auth contexts lists them)\n\nUse \"entire trail [command] --help\" for more information about a command.\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":1458},"formatted_output":"A trail ties together the context for a branch. Use `entire trail` to view, create, update, or watch it; use `entire trail finding` to manage agent findings. The legacy backend is the default; set ENTIRE_TRAILS_BACKEND=entire-api to use the new backend.\n\nUsage:\n  entire trail [flags]\n  entire trail [command]\n\nAvailable Commands:\n  approvals       List approval decisions on a trail\n  approve         Approve a trail\n  checkout        Check out a trail's branch\n  comment         Manage discussion threads on a trail\n  create          Create a trail for the current, a new, or no branch\n  delete          Delete a trail\n  finding         Manage a trail's agent findings\n  list            List recent trails\n  request-changes Request changes on a trail\n  resume          Resume a trail's agent session\n  show            Show a trail\n  update          Update trail metadata\n  watch           Tail a trail's events live\n\nFlags:\n  -h, --help          help for trail\n      --repo string   Target repository as forge/owner/repo (e.g. gh/acme/app) or a clone URL; defaults to the origin remote\n\nGlobal Flags:\n      --context name   Act as this saved login name for this command only, instead of the active context (entire auth contexts lists them)\n\nUse \"entire trail [command] --help\" for more information about a command.\n"},"started_at_ms":1788993791320,"completed_at_ms":1788993791320}}
