{"timestamp":"2026-09-09T23:09:00.530Z","ordinal":13303,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a06465-c2da-73f2-a18c-e3568bc720c2","turn_id":"01a08861-a963-7db3-b7f4-840a0a3e6fdf","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-8a9e3290-aaad-4e06-8006-6eaa523117dd","process_id":"79161","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","entire trail show 1282 --repo gh/entireio/cli --json"],"cwd":"file:///Users/peytonmontei/Documents/Documents%20-%20Peyton%E2%80%99s%20MacBook%20Pro/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/subagents","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"entire trail show 1282 --repo gh/entireio/cli --json"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"{\n  \"number\": 1282,\n  \"trail_id\": \"01M2464KM3DMQYQ7WVMHE637R0\",\n  \"url\": \"https://entire.io/gh/entireio/cli/trails/1282\",\n  \"branch\": \"feat/copilot-subagent-tracking\",\n  \"base\": \"main\",\n  \"title\": \"feat(copilot-cli): track subagent tasks\",\n  \"body\": \"Problem:\\nCopilot CLI 1.0.82+ now emits native subagent hooks and interleaves child events into the parent transcript (rather than using standalone child transcript files). The previous implementation could not correlate subagentStop events to their starts or extract child-scoped files accurately, and falsely attributed unrelated files during condensation.\\nSolution:\\nHook parsing: Added subagentStart hook support and enriched the hook envelope to capture child identity fields (AgentID, AgentType, AgentName, AgentDescription)\\nTranscript correlation: Implemented extractSubagentEvidence() to read parent transcripts and join on child UUIDs via subagent.started events, extracting the stable parent tool call ID for file attribution\\nFile extraction: Updated event parsing to pull files from subagent.started / tool.execution_complete events, where files are indexed by parent task ID and scoped to each child via agentId and parentToolCallId fields\\nTranscript unavailability marker: Added TranscriptUnavailable to TaskRecord to prevent condensation from probing for generic agent-\\u003cid\\u003e.jsonl layouts when a child has no standalone transcript\\nCompletion-only lifecycle: Copilot's stop hook arrives with identity but never saw a start hook (pass-through), so introduced CompletionWithoutLaunch flag to handle creation at completion time without spinning up a phantom session\\nEvent enrichment: SubagentEnd events now carry file lists and task metadata extracted from the parent transcript before the hook runs\\nAll changes are backward-compatible; legacy stops without agentId fall back to matching starts by name when there's exactly one incomplete start.\",\n  \"status\": \"open\",\n  \"phase\": \"reviewing\",\n  \"author\": {\n    \"id\": \"01KSPWEZWS89N7M7Y97XMXP6JV\",\n    \"login\": \"peyton-alt\"\n  },\n  \"assignees\": [\n    \"peyton-alt\"\n  ],\n  \"labels\": [],\n  \"type\": \"task\",\n  \"priority\": \"none\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-09-09T22:55:39.139Z\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-09-09T23:03:26.64Z\",\n  \"merged_at\": null\n}\n","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"{\n  \"number\": 1282,\n  \"trail_id\": \"01M2464KM3DMQYQ7WVMHE637R0\",\n  \"url\": \"https://entire.io/gh/entireio/cli/trails/1282\",\n  \"branch\": \"feat/copilot-subagent-tracking\",\n  \"base\": \"main\",\n  \"title\": \"feat(copilot-cli): track subagent tasks\",\n  \"body\": \"Problem:\\nCopilot CLI 1.0.82+ now emits native subagent hooks and interleaves child events into the parent transcript (rather than using standalone child transcript files). The previous implementation could not correlate subagentStop events to their starts or extract child-scoped files accurately, and falsely attributed unrelated files during condensation.\\nSolution:\\nHook parsing: Added subagentStart hook support and enriched the hook envelope to capture child identity fields (AgentID, AgentType, AgentName, AgentDescription)\\nTranscript correlation: Implemented extractSubagentEvidence() to read parent transcripts and join on child UUIDs via subagent.started events, extracting the stable parent tool call ID for file attribution\\nFile extraction: Updated event parsing to pull files from subagent.started / tool.execution_complete events, where files are indexed by parent task ID and scoped to each child via agentId and parentToolCallId fields\\nTranscript unavailability marker: Added TranscriptUnavailable to TaskRecord to prevent condensation from probing for generic agent-\\u003cid\\u003e.jsonl layouts when a child has no standalone transcript\\nCompletion-only lifecycle: Copilot's stop hook arrives with identity but never saw a start hook (pass-through), so introduced CompletionWithoutLaunch flag to handle creation at completion time without spinning up a phantom session\\nEvent enrichment: SubagentEnd events now carry file lists and task metadata extracted from the parent transcript before the hook runs\\nAll changes are backward-compatible; legacy stops without agentId fall back to matching starts by name when there's exactly one incomplete start.\",\n  \"status\": \"open\",\n  \"phase\": \"reviewing\",\n  \"author\": {\n    \"id\": \"01KSPWEZWS89N7M7Y97XMXP6JV\",\n    \"login\": \"peyton-alt\"\n  },\n  \"assignees\": [\n    \"peyton-alt\"\n  ],\n  \"labels\": [],\n  \"type\": \"task\",\n  \"priority\": \"none\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-09-09T22:55:39.139Z\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-09-09T23:03:26.64Z\",\n  \"merged_at\": null\n}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":3,"nanos":523159500},"formatted_output":"{\n  \"number\": 1282,\n  \"trail_id\": \"01M2464KM3DMQYQ7WVMHE637R0\",\n  \"url\": \"https://entire.io/gh/entireio/cli/trails/1282\",\n  \"branch\": \"feat/copilot-subagent-tracking\",\n  \"base\": \"main\",\n  \"title\": \"feat(copilot-cli): track subagent tasks\",\n  \"body\": \"Problem:\\nCopilot CLI 1.0.82+ now emits native subagent hooks and interleaves child events into the parent transcript (rather than using standalone child transcript files). The previous implementation could not correlate subagentStop events to their starts or extract child-scoped files accurately, and falsely attributed unrelated files during condensation.\\nSolution:\\nHook parsing: Added subagentStart hook support and enriched the hook envelope to capture child identity fields (AgentID, AgentType, AgentName, AgentDescription)\\nTranscript correlation: Implemented extractSubagentEvidence() to read parent transcripts and join on child UUIDs via subagent.started events, extracting the stable parent tool call ID for file attribution\\nFile extraction: Updated event parsing to pull files from subagent.started / tool.execution_complete events, where files are indexed by parent task ID and scoped to each child via agentId and parentToolCallId fields\\nTranscript unavailability marker: Added TranscriptUnavailable to TaskRecord to prevent condensation from probing for generic agent-\\u003cid\\u003e.jsonl layouts when a child has no standalone transcript\\nCompletion-only lifecycle: Copilot's stop hook arrives with identity but never saw a start hook (pass-through), so introduced CompletionWithoutLaunch flag to handle creation at completion time without spinning up a phantom session\\nEvent enrichment: SubagentEnd events now carry file lists and task metadata extracted from the parent transcript before the hook runs\\nAll changes are backward-compatible; legacy stops without agentId fall back to matching starts by name when there's exactly one incomplete start.\",\n  \"status\": \"open\",\n  \"phase\": \"reviewing\",\n  \"author\": {\n    \"id\": \"01KSPWEZWS89N7M7Y97XMXP6JV\",\n    \"login\": \"peyton-alt\"\n  },\n  \"assignees\": [\n    \"peyton-alt\"\n  ],\n  \"labels\": [],\n  \"type\": \"task\",\n  \"priority\": \"none\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-09-09T22:55:39.139Z\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-09-09T23:03:26.64Z\",\n  \"merged_at\": null\n}\n"},"started_at_ms":1788995337007,"completed_at_ms":1788995340530}}
