ation: Implemented extractSubagentEvidence() to read parent transcripts and join on child UUIDs via subagent.started events, extracting the stable parent tool call ID for file attribution\\nFile extraction: Updated event parsing to pull files from subagent.started / tool.execution_complete events, where files are indexed by parent task ID and scoped to each child via agentId and parentToolCallId fields\\nTranscript unavailability marker: Added TranscriptUnavailable to TaskRecord to prevent condensation from probing for generic agent-\\u003cid\\u003e.jsonl layouts when a child has no standalone transcript\\nCompletion-only lifecycle: Copilot's stop hook arrives with identity but never saw a start hook (pass-through), so introduced CompletionWithoutLaunch flag to handle creation at completion time without spinning up a phantom session\\nEvent enrichment: SubagentEnd events now carry file lists and task metadata extracted from the parent transcript before the hook runs\\nAll changes are backward-compatible; legacy stops without agentId fall back to matching starts by name when there's exactly one incomplete start.\",\n  \"status\": \"open\",\n  \"phase\": \"reviewing\",\n  \"author\": {\n    \"id\": \"01KSPWEZWS89N7M7Y97XMXP6JV\",\n    \"login\": \"peyton-alt\"\n  },\n  \"assignees\": [\n    \"peyton-alt\"\n  ],\n  \"labels\": [],\n  \"type\": \"task\",\n  \"priority\": \"none\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-09-09T22:55:39.139Z\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-09-09T23:03:26.64Z\",\n  \"merged_at\": null\n}\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a08861-a963-7db3-b7f4-840a0a3e6fdf","create_time":1788995340.590098}}}
