{"timestamp":"2026-09-09T23:09:33.289Z","ordinal":13318,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a06465-c2da-73f2-a18c-e3568bc720c2","turn_id":"01a08861-a963-7db3-b7f4-840a0a3e6fdf","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0cd19a3be99e9a99016aa1e72bd4a887d0898a4017c76f51b7","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The initial Entire failure had two causes:\n\n- Manual approval missing—expected and not something I can satisfy.\n- One unresolved high-severity finding—actionable and must be inspected.\n\nCursor and Copilot reviewers found no issues. The local finding command returned a backend/API mismatch, so I’m checking its exact invocation and the trail’s discussion data before updating the head."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1788995371863,"completed_at_ms":1788995373289}}
