{"timestamp":"2026-09-09T23:09:39.550Z","ordinal":13322,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a06465-c2da-73f2-a18c-e3568bc720c2","turn_id":"01a08861-a963-7db3-b7f4-840a0a3e6fdf","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-e93500a1-8873-41b4-890c-a508c80ee89b","process_id":"46061","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","entire trail finding list --help"],"cwd":"file:///Users/peytonmontei/Documents/Documents%20-%20Peyton%E2%80%99s%20MacBook%20Pro/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/subagents","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"entire trail finding list --help"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"List findings for a trail\n\nUsage:\n  entire trail finding list [<trail>] [flags]\n\nFlags:\n      --freshness string    Filter code-version freshness: current,stale,any (default \"current\")\n  -h, --help                help for list\n      --include-dismissed   Include dismissed findings\n      --json                Output as JSON\n  -n, --limit int           Maximum number of findings to show (default 100)\n      --offset int          Pagination offset\n      --severity string     Filter by comma-separated severity value(s): high,medium,low\n      --status string       Filter by lifecycle status(es): open,resolved,dismissed; use 'any' for all (default \"open\")\n\nGlobal Flags:\n      --branch string   Resolve the trail for this branch instead of the current branch; cannot be combined with a trail selector\n      --context name    Act as this saved login name for this command only, instead of the active context (entire auth contexts lists them)\n      --repo string     Target repository as forge/owner/repo (e.g. gh/acme/app) or a clone URL; defaults to the origin remote\n      --trail string    Trail selector (number, id, or branch); defaults to the current branch's trail\n","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"List findings for a trail\n\nUsage:\n  entire trail finding list [<trail>] [flags]\n\nFlags:\n      --freshness