{"timestamp":"2026-09-09T23:11:35.228Z","ordinal":13365,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a06465-c2da-73f2-a18c-e3568bc720c2","turn_id":"01a08861-a963-7db3-b7f4-840a0a3e6fdf","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-0a6b0a0f-977f-482e-a264-93b1d6b28fd7","server":"node_repl","tool":"js","arguments":{"code":"nodeRepl.write(await agent.documentation.get(\"bootstrap-troubleshooting\"));","title":"Check browser connection help"},"readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Browser Runtime Troubleshooting\n- If browser setup completed but discovery or selection fails, reuse the existing `agent`; do not reset the JavaScript session or import another browser runtime.\n- Inspect `await agent.browsers.list()` once to see which browser types are available. Do not assume that a missing requested browser can be replaced with another backend when the user explicitly named it.\n- If a requested backend has specific troubleshooting documentation in the skill's setup catalog, read it before retrying.\n- If the requested browser remains unavailable, report that plainly instead of controlling it through an unrelated browser tool or source-code workaround.\n"}],"isError":false,"_meta":{"codex/nodeReplExecutionDurationMs":8}},"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":17278416}},"started_at_ms":1788995495211,"completed_at_ms":1788995495228}}
