{"timestamp":"2026-09-09T23:14:45.404Z","ordinal":13480,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a06465-c2da-73f2-a18c-e3568bc720c2","turn_id":"01a08861-a963-7db3-b7f4-840a0a3e6fdf","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0cd19a3be99e9a99016aa1e862dc4887d09548fd284b920cd9","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The PR is open, and I’m finishing the required gate-closure loop before handing it back. The initial review caught one valid high-severity edge case, so I’ve made the smallest targeted validation change and am verifying it now.\n\n`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\n- Task-record validation now happens before either transcript path can emit checkpoint payload, so “transcript unavailable” records cannot bypass the same AgentID safety rule as normal records.\n- The regression case was added to the existing poisoned-record test, preserving its core contract—skip malformed records without wedging the entire checkpoint—without introducing a new test harness.\n`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`"}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1788995682914,"completed_at_ms":1788995685403}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-09T23:14:45.405Z","ordinal":13481,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_0cd19a3be99e9a99016aa1e862dc4887d09548fd284b920cd9","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"The PR is open, and I’m finishing the required gate-closure loop before handing it back. The initial review caught one valid high-severity edge case, so I’ve made the smallest targeted validation change and am verifying it now.\n\n`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\n- Task-record validation now happens before either transcript path can emit checkpoint payload, so “transcript unavailable” records cannot bypass the same AgentID safety rule as normal records.\n- The regression case was added to the existing poisoned-record test, preserving its core contract—skip malformed records without wedging the entire checkpoint—without introducing a new test harness.\n`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`"}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a08861-a963-7db3-b7f4-840a0a3e6fdf","create_time":1788995681.904124,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}}}
