{"timestamp":"2026-09-09T23:18:53.513Z","ordinal":13545,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a06465-c2da-73f2-a18c-e3568bc720c2","turn_id":"01a08861-a963-7db3-b7f4-840a0a3e6fdf","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0cd19a3be99e9a99016aa1e95b5d7887d0b9b9613fa12ffc2d","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The full required check passed: formatting, all linters, race-enabled unit/integration tests, Vogon canary 56/56, and Roger-Roger 4/4.\n\n`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\n- The behavior change is a dominance fix: the same AgentID validator now guards every downstream payload path, so there is one rule rather than divergent “with transcript” and “without transcript” behavior.\n- The checkpoint remains fail-open at the record level: malformed records are skipped and retired, while valid sibling task records still materialize normally.\n`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`\n\nI’m committing this focused review fix next, then I’ll run the separately required pre-push lint pass."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1788995931413,"completed_at_ms":1788995933513}}
