{"timestamp":"2026-09-09T23:39:50.479Z","ordinal":13740,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a06465-c2da-73f2-a18c-e3568bc720c2","turn_id":"01a08861-a963-7db3-b7f4-840a0a3e6fdf","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0cd19a3be99e9a99016aa1ee43584087d0b454a18d89fef272","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The regression failed before the code change by creating `toolu_copilot_late`, then passed after switching to `state.IsEnded()`. The documentation field now matches the actual parser schema.\n\n`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\n- The test uses the exact inconsistent persisted shape that motivated `IsEnded()`—active phase plus non-nil `EndedAt`—so it would not pass accidentally under the old raw enum check.\n- No lifecycle algorithm changed: this only reuses the repository’s existing definition of “finalized,” and the documentation correction has no runtime footprint.\n`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`\n\nI’m checking the exact diff size, then rerunning the mandatory full suite before the final review-fix commit."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1788997187421,"completed_at_ms":1788997190478}}
